  "name": "交互质感",
  "nav": "交互质感",
  "en": "Interaction feel",
  "group": "基础",
  "specRef": "",
  "summary": "把悬停按压、半路打断、4px 起拖与乐观回退放进四个可动手试的真实交互，直接感受手感差异。",
  "acceptance": [
    "按钮按压缩至 97%（100ms），列表行只叠底色不缩放；键盘聚焦仅在 `:focus-visible` 显示 2px 焦点环。",
    "连续切换目标时从此刻实时坐标接续过渡，绝不跳回起点或排队等待。",
    "拖拽满 4px 才浮起并实时补位，按 Esc 原路取消；乐观操作保存失败时左右轻抖两下并恢复原状。"
  ],
  "api": [],
  "usage": null,
  "example": null,
  "demos": [
    {
      "caption": "",
      "html": "<div class=\"fl-grid\" id=\"feelLab\">\n  <div class=\"fl-pane\">\n    <div class=\"fl-hd\"><b>悬停与按下</b><span class=\"fl-stat\" data-fl-press-stat>按钮 97% · 行不缩放</span></div>\n    <div class=\"fl-bd fl-bd-press\">\n      <div class=\"fl-btns\">\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"sn-btn sn-primary sn-sm\" data-fl-primary>保存修改</button>\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"sn-btn sn-secondary sn-sm\">另存副本</button>\n      </div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"fl-list-row\" data-fl-row aria-pressed=\"false\">\n        <b>第三集 · 雨夜车站</b>\n        <span class=\"sn-num\">12 个镜头</span>\n      </button>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"fl-pane\">\n    <div class=\"fl-hd\"><b>中途打断</b><span class=\"fl-stat\" data-fl-int-stat>快速连点体验折返</span></div>\n    <div class=\"fl-bd fl-bd-int\">\n      <div class=\"fl-seg\" role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"视图切换\">\n        <span class=\"fl-seg-thumb\" data-fl-thumb aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n        <button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" data-fl-tab=\"0\" aria-selected=\"true\" class=\"sn-on\">分镜</button>\n        <button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" data-fl-tab=\"1\" aria-selected=\"false\">时间线</button>\n        <button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" data-fl-tab=\"2\" aria-selected=\"false\">调色</button>\n        <button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" data-fl-tab=\"3\" aria-selected=\"false\">混音</button>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"fl-track\" data-fl-track aria-hidden=\"true\">\n        <span class=\"fl-puck\" data-fl-puck></span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"fl-pane fl-pane-drag\">\n    <div class=\"fl-hd\"><b>拖拽重排</b><span class=\"fl-stat\" data-fl-drag-stat>拖过 4px 浮起 · Esc 取消</span></div>\n    <div class=\"fl-bd fl-bd-drag\">\n      <div class=\"sn-drag-list fl-drag-list\" data-fl-drag></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"fl-pane\">\n    <div class=\"fl-hd\"><b>乐观更新</b><span class=\"fl-stat\" data-fl-opt-stat>先响应再保存</span></div>\n    <div class=\"fl-bd fl-bd-opt\">\n      <div class=\"sn-opt-row fl-opt-row\" data-fl-opt-row>\n        <span class=\"sn-nm\">雨夜车站 · 精选场次</span>\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"sn-btn sn-secondary sn-sm fl-star\" data-fl-star aria-pressed=\"false\">\n          <span data-i=\"star\"></span>\n          <span class=\"sn-num\" data-fl-num>18</span>\n        </button>\n      </div>\n      <label class=\"sn-check fl-fail\" data-c><input type=\"checkbox\" data-fl-fail>模拟保存失败（抖动并回退）</label>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>"
    }
